  "type": "Click",
  "display_name": "Mental Strike",
  "display_fullname": "Tanker Melee Psionic Melee Mental Strike",
  "display_help": "You project psionic energy around your fist and strike at your foe dealing light Psionic and Smashing damage. Affected foes will have their recharge rate reduced. Mental Strike has a small chance to grant you Insight. While you have Insight, Mental Strike will deal additional minor psionic damage over time. This power can bruise an enemy, making them more vulnerable to damage. Damage: Light, Recharge: Very Fast",
